.env*
# The router plugin's scratch directory. It writes a uniquely-named temp file on every codegen run,
# so left tracked it adds one junk file per build to every commit.
apps/web/.tanstack/

# UNSPENT BEARER SECRETS, AND THIS IS A SECURITY LINE RATHER THAN A TIDINESS ONE.
#
# A position secret IS the money: `poseidon(secret)` is the commitment, and the contracts pay
# whoever presents the preimage — no address is checked, because not checking one is the entire
# point. So a live secret in a public repository is a public claim on the position, and this
# repository is going public.
#
# `evidence/` keeps the SPENT ones on purpose: once a position is CLAIMED the preimage buys nothing,
# and leaving it in lets any reader hash it themselves and watch the commitment fall out — the
# scheme demonstrated rather than asserted. Anything still claimable lives here instead, and
# `evidence/` points at it by name.
.secrets/
